config AIC8800
	bool "AICSemi AIC8800 SDIO Wi-Fi"
	depends on CFG80211 && MMC
	help
	  The AICSemi AIC8800 family over SDIO, Wi-Fi only: aic8800_bsp (SDIO
	  transport, chip bring-up, firmware download) and aic8800_fdrv (the
	  FullMAC cfg80211 driver). The firmware it requests must be built in
	  (EXTRA_FIRMWARE): it runs before the root filesystem is mounted.
